# Custom Macros Showcase

This document demonstrates text macros, inline macros, and parameterized macro expansions in Zolto Phase 9.

---

## Macro Definitions

macro note(text)
info
{text}
end

macro warning(text)
warning
⚠️ **Warning:** {text}
end

macro version()
10.0.0
end

macro author()
Zolto Core Team
end

---

## Macro Usage

Current Engine Version: version()
Document Author: author()

note("Custom macros expand during AST compilation prior to HTML rendering.")

